<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Not found · Hackerly</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main style="min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px">
    <div style="max-width:44ch;text-align:center">
      <div class="brand" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:28px">
        <span class="brand__mark" aria-hidden="true">H</span><span>Hackerly</span>
      </div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Error 404</p>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,2.6rem);margin-bottom:14px">We could not find that page.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin:0 auto 26px">
        The link may be wrong, or the hackathon it pointed to is no longer public. Nothing is broken on your side.
      </p>
      <div class="row" style="justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/hackathons">Browse hackathons</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/">Go to the homepage</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
